<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Netcare subsidiary buys strategic property.</title>
<headline>Netcare subsidiary buys strategic property.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Network Healthcare Holdings Ltd announced on Wednesday that subsidiary Sunninghill Property Services had acquired property which was strategically contiguous with its Sunninghill Hospital property.</p>
<p>It said the property would provide the hospital with capacity for expanded medical facilities and hospital support services.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
